<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo stock exchange curtails trade on poll day.</title>
<headline>Colombo stock exchange curtails trade on poll day.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange said in a statement on Thursday that trading hours will be shortened on Friday due to local government elections.</p>
<p>It said trading will take place between 9.00 a.m. (0300 GMT) and 11.30 a.m instead of the usual 9.00 a.m to 12.30 p.m.</p>
<p>Sri Lankans vote in local government elections on Friday to elect members to some 228 councils.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
